{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t在手機上觀看「微短劇」的人越來越多。有數據顯示，上月份全球海外的微短劇前100大排行榜，有82部就由中國業界推出。<br/>\n<br/>\n這股熱潮更加已擴展至外國。有報道指，今年上半年，印尼、印度、巴西、菲律賓和墨西哥為海外短劇APP下載量最大的5個國家，佔近6成半；而美國、日本、韓國、英國和巴西，是付費短劇淨收入最大的5個國家。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:23:55.805464+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:49:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:58:40.862995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:26.448655+00:00","content_hash":"abd614119e7ed9d58d9efbda0cb466ce95ea4849efccf7dfa6b26d88c363ead1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}